  "details": "I request the implementation of advertising poster objects that can be placed within worlds.\n\nThese objects would be provided via the VRC SDK and function simply by being placed within a world. Only VRC+ users would be able to place these objects, and placing them would generate revenue for the world creator.\n\nAdvertisements would be placed by general VRC+ users paying advertising fees. A portion of these advertising fees would serve as a commission for VRChat operations.\n\nWhile ad posters themselves are already visible in some worlds, having VRChat officially handle their placement and display would simplify the process and provide financial support to VRChat operations.",
